Subject: [PATCH 1578/3799] soh: rename func_80A40DCC ->
 EnGo_WaitForEyedropsText

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: waits out the eye-drops line, resets the animation and hands over to the get-item state.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Go/z_en_go.c
index 0fbf9d1bc..52ec88538 100644
